    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Verifies that {@link XmlStreamWriter} correctly handles UTF-16BE encoding. <p>The XML prolog explicitly declares {@code encoding=\"UTF-16BE\"}. The writer must: <ul> <li>Parse the prolog and detect UTF-16BE as the target charset.</li> <li>Encode the entire document — including multi-script Unicode content — in UTF-16BE.</li> <li>Produce bytes identical to a direct {@code String.getBytes(\"UTF-16BE\")} call.</li> </ul>"
